  "layout_pacing_advice": "To achieve a truly immersive editorial experience, alternate wide cinematic hero stills with intimate asymmetrical macro crops in a generous 12-column grid. Intersperse quiet, narrative text passages in Cormorant Garamond serif with full-bleed atmospheric imagery, ensuring high contrast using gold (#C5A059) and cream (#FDFBF7) typography over deep burgundy (#3B0C11) backdrops. Use subtle 0.3s fade-in transitions and wax-seal decorative iconography to make reading feel like leafing through a bespoke luxury monograph rather than browsing an agency portfolio.",
